    <title>Privacy Policy — Aquatic Dreams Swim Modesto</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Aquatic Dreams Swim Modesto privacy policy, including SMS disclosures for phone numbers, opt-in data, opt-out instructions, and data safeguards."
    />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://aquaticdreamsswim.com/privacy-policy" />
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light; --teal: #2a5e84; --coral: #f58b76; --sand: #f7f3ee; --ink: #17324a; --muted: #5e7183; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: var(--ink); background: #fff; line-height: 1.6; }
      header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--sand), #fff); border-bottom: 4px solid var(--coral); padding: 42px 20px 34px; }
      main { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 34px 20px 56px; }
      .wrap { max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--teal); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 52px); line-height: 1.05; }
      h2 { margin: 34px 0 8px; color: var(--teal); font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; }
      p, li { font-size: 16px; }
      a { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; }
      .date { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 10px; }
      .sms-box { border: 2px solid var(--teal); border-left: 8px solid var(--coral); padding: 18px 20px; background: #fbfdff; margin-top: 16px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Aquatic Dreams Swim Modesto</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="date">Effective May 1, 2025</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <p>
        Aquatic Dreams Modesto, LLC ("Aquatic Dreams," "we," "us," or "our") operates
        aquaticdreamsswim.com and related swim lesson enrollment services. This Privacy Policy explains
        what information we collect, how we use it, how we protect it, and your rights, including our
        dedicated SMS text messaging privacy disclosures.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you enroll a swimmer, contact us, or use our website, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Parent or guardian name, email address, mobile phone number, and home address.</li>
        <li>Student name, date of birth, age, and swim-skill assessment responses.</li>
        <li>Emergency contact name and phone number.</li>
        <li>Health and medical information voluntarily disclosed during enrollment.</li>
        <li>Payment information, processed securely by Stripe; we do not store full card numbers.</li>
        <li>Account login credentials and technical data such as IP address, browser type, device type, and cookies.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To process enrollment, manage class bookings, and administer your account.</li>
        <li>To collect tuition payments and send billing communications.</li>
        <li>To send enrollment confirmations, lesson reminders, schedule changes, cancellations, and account messages by email and SMS text message.</li>
        <li>To respond to inquiries, provide customer support, and operate our swim lesson programs.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. SMS / Text Messaging Privacy</h2>
      <div class="sms-box">
        <p>
          Aquatic Dreams Swim Modesto collects mobile phone numbers only when a parent or guardian provides
          a number during enrollment and actively checks the SMS consent box. We use that phone number to send
          lesson reminders, schedule changes, registration confirmations, payment links, cancellations, and
          other transactional account messages related to your swimmer.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>
            We do not sell, rent, share, or disclose mobile phone numbers or SMS opt-in information to third
            parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.
          </strong>
          Mobile information is shared only with our SMS service provider, TextMagic, solely to deliver the
          messages you requested. No mobile information is shared with third parties or affiliates for their own
          marketing or promotional purposes.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>How to opt out:</strong> You can stop receiving SMS messages at any time by replying
          <strong> STOP</strong> to any message. After STOP, we send one final confirmation and you will not
          receive further SMS messages from us. For help, reply <strong>HELP</strong>, call
          <a href="tel:2095773483">(209) 577-3483</a>, or email
          <a href="mailto:info@aquaticdreamsswim.com">info@aquaticdreamsswim.com</a>.
          See our <a href="/sms-terms">SMS Terms &amp; Conditions</a> for full SMS program terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>4. How We Share Information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or trade personal information. We share information only with service providers
        necessary to operate our services, including Stripe for payment processing, our secure backend database
        provider, Resend for transactional email, and TextMagic for SMS delivery. These providers may use data
        only to perform services for us. We may also disclose information when required by law, court order, or
        governmental authority.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Data Security and Safeguards</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect user data, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>HTTPS / TLS encrypted transmission across the website.</li>
        <li>Encrypted-at-rest cloud storage with role-based access controls.</li>
        <li>Access restrictions so only authorized staff can view family, student, and enrollment data.</li>
        <li>Secure authentication for parent and staff accounts.</li>
        <li>Payment card processing handled by PCI-DSS compliant Stripe.</li>
        <li>Vendor agreements requiring service providers to protect data on our behalf.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our programs serve children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from
        children under 13. Enrollment information is collected from and managed by a parent or legal guardian.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        We use essential cookies to operate the website, analytics cookies to understand usage, and preference
        cookies to remember settings.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        California residents may request to know what personal information we have collected, request deletion,
        and exercise the right to opt out of sale. We do not sell personal information. To make a request,
        contact us using the information below.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be communicated to enrolled
        families by email at least 14 days before they take effect.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Aquatic Dreams Modesto, LLC<br />
        1212 Kansas Ave, Modesto, CA 95351<br />
        <a href="tel:2095773483">(209) 577-3483</a> ·
        <a href="mailto:info@aquaticdreamsswim.com">info@aquaticdreamsswim.com</a>
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>